# Identifying AI Fictions

#### Review each of the scenarios below to identify the AI fiction.

#### 👉 Click to reveal the answer.

>#### **💬 Quick Reflection:** Try to identify the AI fiction yourself before clicking to show the answer.

--- 

<div style="max-width:900px; margin:20px auto; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#292F36;">

<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;">
Scenario 1
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; color:#555; margin-bottom:10px;">
A 5th-grade teacher is preparing a quick mini-lesson on ecosystems and wants to include an engaging fact about the Amazon rainforest. They use AI to generate a quick explanation.
</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:4px;">
<div style="font-size:16px">
✨ The Amazon rainforest produces 50% of the world’s oxygen, making it the “lungs of the Earth.”
</div>
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
<p><strong>Why this is AI fiction:</strong><br>
This response includes a widely repeated but misleading statistic that oversimplifies how oxygen cycles work. It sounds authoritative and complete, but presents an inaccurate claim without context or verification.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;">
Scenario 2
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; color:#555; margin-bottom:10px;">
A 6th-grade math teacher is planning a lesson on ratios and wants to better support a wide range of learners in their classroom. They ask AI for ideas on how to differentiate the assignment.
</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:4px;">
<div style="font-size:16px">
✨ A good way to differentiate this lesson is to give struggling students an easier version of the assignment and advanced students a harder version. This ensures all students are working at the right level.
</div>
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
<p><strong>Why this is AI fiction:</strong><br>
This response oversimplifies differentiation by reducing it to “easier vs. harder” tasks, which does not reflect best instructional practice. It presents a partial and potentially misleading strategy as if it were complete and effective.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;">
Scenario 3
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; color:#555; margin-bottom:10px;">
An 8th-grade science student is researching climate change for a class project. They use AI to help summarize key causes and possible solutions.
</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:4px;">
<div style="font-size:16px">
✨ Climate change is mainly caused by pollution from factories, so reducing industrial emissions is the most important solution.
</div>
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
<p><strong>Why this is AI fiction:</strong><br>
This response overgeneralizes a complex issue by focusing on a single cause and solution, leaving out important contributing factors. It presents an incomplete explanation in a confident tone, which can mislead learners.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;">
Scenario 4
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; color:#555; margin-bottom:10px;">
A 9th-grade social studies teacher is grading short-answer responses about a historical event and uses AI to help generate feedback for students. One student submits an answer that shows partial understanding but includes some confusion.
</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:4px;">
<div style="font-size:16px">
✨ This response is incorrect because it does not match the expected answer. The student should review the material and try again.
</div>
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
<p><strong>Why this is AI fiction:</strong><br>
This response assumes a single correct answer and ignores the student’s partial understanding or reasoning. It provides incomplete and unhelpful feedback while presenting itself as sufficient.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #D9DDE3; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 18px; background-color:#F7F8FA;">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;">
Scenario 5
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; color:#555; margin-bottom:10px;">
A 10th-grade English teacher is supporting a student who is revising an essay. The student uses AI to get feedback on how to improve their writing.
</div>
<div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:4px;">
<div style="font-size:16px">
✨ To improve this essay, you should replace simple words with more advanced vocabulary and make your sentences longer. For example, instead of saying “The character is sad,” you could write “The character is experiencing profound melancholy.” This will make your writing more sophisticated.
</div>
</div>
</summary>

<div style="padding:18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;">
<p><strong>Why this is AI fiction:</strong><br>
This response promotes a narrow and misleading view of good writing by equating complexity with quality. It ignores important elements like clarity, voice, and purpose while presenting its advice as universally correct.</p>
</div>
</details>

</div>
MARKDOWN
